{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01411",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.91,
      "end_seconds": 6.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Doctor, I've brought them through. The observations are done, whenever you need them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.31,
      "end_seconds": 12.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Perfect, thanks. Hello there, so what's the trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.23,
      "end_seconds": 21.63,
      "duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "text": "Uh, doctor, it's a burn on my forearm. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.44,
      "end_seconds": 25.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.91,
      "end_seconds": 54.59,
      "duration_seconds": 28.68,
      "text": "Oh, it's been like this since last weekend. I've, I've also had stinging pain. As for stinging pain, I'd say a couple of times a week. As for blister, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.84,
      "end_seconds": 61.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.6,
      "end_seconds": 69.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Just part of my thyroid removed, years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.02,
      "end_seconds": 88.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.42,
      "end_seconds": 98.26,
      "duration_seconds": 8.84,
      "text": "Sorry, uh, what was I saying, my father has Parkinson's disease. My son has asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.94,
      "end_seconds": 103.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.86,
      "end_seconds": 107.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.53,
      "end_seconds": 115.81,
      "duration_seconds": 7.28,
      "text": "So, tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions. Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.28,
      "end_seconds": 128.48,
      "duration_seconds": 8.2,
      "text": "I've had thin bones, yes. Migraines, for two years. I have heart failure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.42,
      "end_seconds": 133.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Alright, migraines, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.17,
      "end_seconds": 157.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "Okay, tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.13,
      "end_seconds": 173.75,
      "duration_seconds": 14.62,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette. I only drink at family occasions. I do a yoga class on Thursdays. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.26,
      "end_seconds": 177.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.41,
      "end_seconds": 183.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "I'm on alendronate, 70 milligrams, maybe, once a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.07,
      "end_seconds": 190.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "Okay, do you have the packet or the prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.67,
      "end_seconds": 201.25,
      "duration_seconds": 8.58,
      "text": "Erm, no, it's at home. It's spironolactone, 25 milligrams, once a day for my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 203.06,
      "end_seconds": 208.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 50 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.51,
      "end_seconds": 218.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Okay. Have you got the newest prescription or the box with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.22,
      "end_seconds": 224.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "No, you know, I left it at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.24,
      "end_seconds": 230.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "And what about numbness at the burn or burn to the face?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.15,
      "end_seconds": 239.24,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "I haven't had numbness at the burn or burn to the face, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.77,
      "end_seconds": 243.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "And fever, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.4,
      "end_seconds": 248.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.07,
      "end_seconds": 252.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Okay, your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.12,
      "end_seconds": 259.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "No, you know, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.43,
      "end_seconds": 265.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.16,
      "end_seconds": 268.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 281.57,
      "end_seconds": 291.07,
      "duration_seconds": 9.5,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Heart rate 67, BP is 112 over 68, respiratory rate 18, temp 36.7 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.52,
      "end_seconds": 293.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.52,
      "end_seconds": 299.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.28,
      "end_seconds": 302.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.15,
      "end_seconds": 322.61,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "text": "It's a small superficial burn with an intact blister, about the size of a palm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.27,
      "end_seconds": 336.56,
      "duration_seconds": 11.29,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. So, based on the history and the examination, I think we're dealing with a minor superficial burn at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.36,
      "end_seconds": 340.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.85,
      "end_seconds": 358.69,
      "duration_seconds": 17.84,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a minor superficial burn, and we'll watch how it goes. The treatment will be paracetamol, 1 gram, every six hours when needed, three days. That's for burn pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.44,
      "end_seconds": 362.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.61,
      "end_seconds": 392.64,
      "duration_seconds": 29.03,
      "text": "Cool it under running water for twenty minutes if it happens again, and leave the blister intact. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Let's plan a check in two days. Can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 393.62,
      "end_seconds": 405.86,
      "duration_seconds": 12.24,
      "text": "So, I take the paracetamol, 1 gram, every six hours when needed and come back in two days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 406.96,
      "end_seconds": 412.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "Right, yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 414.17,
      "end_seconds": 417.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 418.7,
      "end_seconds": 420.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Okay, goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}